worker_module_budget
  module "formal_ai_worker_web_search_and_projects.js"
  ceiling 1250
  rationale "Reciprocal rank fusion and the web-search handler, promoted projects and GitHub repository lookups, response-language follow-ups and formalization matching. Issue #658 cut this module out of one oversized worker file by line count; R1188-U5 named it after what it holds. Its ceiling falls as its logic moves into js/wasm-worker. Ceiling 1314 (2026-10-07, PR #1188): tryProjectLookup leaves an install guide being converted to installation_conversion, which Rust asks before its repository lookup. Ceiling moved to 1316 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the response-language follow-up reads its terse word limit from the policy block of data/seed/handler-rules.lino and declines the same inconclusive replay intents as the native engine (concept_lookup_unresolved). Ceiling moved 1316 to 1318: tryResponseLanguageFollowup declines a directive that forbids the language it names (R384 follow-up, 2026-10-08), as try_response_language_followup does natively. Lowered to 1309 for issue #918 (2026-10-08): the four-language web search text table became seeded web_search_* responses read by webSearchTexts. Lowered to 1250 for issue #1175 R3 (last five rows, 2026-10-08): tryGithubRepositoryTraffic runs the github_repository_traffic rules, which name the repository the prompt names, instead of a four-role recognizer that always named the agent-info repository. Ceiling moved 1250 to 1253 (R1188-U5): the first comment lines say what the module holds, and the unknown-research stopwords consult LOOKUP_STEM_STOPWORDS when a token is checked instead of copying it while this module loads. Ceiling moved 1253 to 1285 (R1188-U29, 2026-10-09): projectLookupPhaseAdmits runs project lookup in the two phases rust/src/meta_method_dispatch.rs does, read from data/seed/method-execution.lino: an explicit repository reference early unless a fetch or navigation URL claims it, and a name lookup only after the methods marked project_lookup fallback decline, never on the identity route. Lowered 1285 to1250 (R1188-U29, 2026-10-10): curated description/fetch projection moved to project_summaries; promoted lookup renders shared seeded Short summaries while retaining actual live fused snippets and diagnostics. No existing module ceiling increased."
